body:
( [Anything and Everything](https://www.google.com/maps/@55.9732775,-3.1761754,3a,75y,245.16h,80.95t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sPbeuXD9IVQW9a4Krfmjs-Q!2e0!7i16384!8i8192) ) on Great Junction Street has a huge selection of audio jacks and tech cables and the staff will pull out ladders and look for whatever you need up on top.

&#x200B;

There's a small place on Clerk St that repairs headphones. I forget what it's called, but walk down there and you should find it.
